# Global

- Canonical virtualenv: **`.venv/`** only — never `venv/`.
- Backend tests: **`python3 scripts/run_pytest.py`** from repo root — never bare `pytest`.
- OpenAPI export: **`python3 scripts/run_export_openapi.py`** (or `--check`).
- Read **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)** before broad architecture or cross-domain changes.
- When behavior, commands, contracts, or architecture change, check whether docs need updating (see `docs-maintenance.mdc`).
